  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n(a + (1)/(a)) = 6\n\n**Formula used:**\n\n(a + (1)/(a)) ² = a² + 1/a² + 2\n\n⇒ a2 + 1/a2 = (a + (1)/(a)) 2 - 2\n\n**Calculation:** \n\n (3)/(4)(a²+(1)/(a²))\n\n⇒ 3/4 ( (a + (1)/(a)) 2 - 2)\n\n⇒ (3/4) ( (6) 2 - 2)\n\n⇒ (3/4) × (36 - 2)\n\n⇒ (3/4) × (34)\n\n⇒ 3 × (8.5) = 25.5\n\n**∴ The correct option is** 3",
